# Merge on a dedicated Debian/Raspberry Pi OS relay only. See REMOTE-ACCESS.md.
# Synthetic site A. Each person receives a separate account/key for revocation.
# Group lab-forwarders must have no sudo, docker, lxd, disk or admin privileges.
# Verify a non-root administrator can log in using a key before reloading.
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitUserEnvironment no
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no

Match Group lab-forwarders
    AuthenticationMethods publickey
    PasswordAuthentication no
    KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
    AllowTcpForwarding local
    AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
    PermitOpen 10.77.10.30:8080 10.77.10.20:8081
    PermitListen none
    GatewayPorts no
    PermitTunnel no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no
    PermitTTY no
    PermitUserRC no
    MaxSessions 0
Match all
